				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;American Transmission Company LLC (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) has a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;00 million unsecured, private placement, commercial paper program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="-aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Investors are limited to qualified institutional buyers and institutional accredited investors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="-aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Maturities may be up to 364 days from date of issue, with proceeds to be used for working capital and other capital expenditures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="-aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pricing is par, less a discount or, if interest-bearing, at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;par.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="-aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ATC had approximately $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;217&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; million of commercial paper outstanding as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;June 30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;6,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; at an average interest rate of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;4.11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; percent.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; has a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;00 million, five-year revolving credit facility, which expire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;March 21, 2030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;The facility provides backup liquidity to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;#x2019;s commercial paper program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; has not borrowed under the revolving credit facility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;In the event of a borrowing, interest rates on the outstanding balance under the facility would be based on a floating rate plus a margin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;The current applicable margin, which is based on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;#x2019;s credit ratings of A+/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;, is 0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; percent.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ATC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;#x2019;s current authority to issue debt was authorized by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) in Docket Number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;ES2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;36&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; and ES26-37-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; issued by FERC on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;May 29, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;This authorization is effective for a two-year period which commenced on July 1, 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;6,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt; and expires on June 30, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;ol start="7" type="1" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:14.17pt; margin-bottom:12pt; padding-left:3.83pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;See Notes to the Financial Statements Page 122&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;See Notes to the Financial Statements Page 122&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;Ms. Gale A. Norton retired from the ATC Management Inc. Board of Directors, effective June 10, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:12pt; text-align:justify; line-height:14pt; font-family:'Arial Narrow'; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock id="HHD2B1DFDF71C7477E84AEA1D4D780024C" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="HH9BC0EFBCB25FD35BD21CC5095A000F66" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
